<title>FRANCE: ALPINE SKIING-SYKORA WINS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-SYKORA WINS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMONIX, France 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas Sykora of Austria won a men's World Cup slalom on Sunday.  </p>
<p>Thomas Stangassinger, also of Austria, finished second</p>
<p>with Swede Martin Hansson in third.</p>
</text>
